            "description": {
              "value": "You squeeze your opponent in a vicious bear hug, putting intense pressure on their nerves, joints, or other pain points.\n\nAttempt an Athletics check to Grapple the creature you have grabbed or restrained, with the following effects instead of the usual effects.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The target is clumsy 2 until the end of its next turn and clumsy 1 for 1 minute.\n- **Success:** The target is clumsy 1 until the end of its next turn."
